en  you 助册 for help to buy machine :)but if   open to 100 player have enough mob can k ?  so need more large area money i think is more easy if neeed money to registar then  at leat i need pay one char  for each guild :P but when buy machine who to care it ?? and when god gradaduate how to deal with that 设备 ? i i say money is more easy hope ES haev a better home  and better future   ps : so please open monk guild soon ok ? ^_^","time":774818071,"poster":"Tycoon",]),(["id":177,"body":"     我赞成收费式的方法购买机器 ,     大家为自己的福利著想 ,     100 元实在算不了多少 ......     至於因 Crash 造成遗憾的玩家档案 ,     希望大神快些作出决定来 ,     还有能否完全砍掉残馀的 File ?     不然无法再以原人物重新创设 ...     谢谢诸位大神巫师的辛劳          希望 ES 的明天会更好                                档案损毁的 Son :~~","title":" 关於收费及档案损毁","time":774838270,"poster":"Sonii",]),(["id":179,"body":" 我们喜爱 ES , 我们愿意付出一些些使 ES 更好 ...      联合署名 :        Mineral , Roria , Pallas , Tu , Sd , Wd , Wang , Solid , Crew ,        Poem , Fos , Lica , Te , Tea , Rock , Lik , Kla , Akira , Kenwahl ,        Pure , Windsad , Jj , Terryh , Nancy ...","title":"我们支持玩家付费的建议","time":774846797,"poster":"Pallas",]),})
